---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StatusDashboard from '../components/StatusDashboard.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" description="SpaceAge - Open PBEM Campaign Lobby">
  <section class="hero">
	<div class="hero-content">
	  <h1>SpaceAge Campaign</h1>
	  <p class="tagline">An Open Play-by-Email Galactic Strategy Game</p>

	  <div class="flavour">
		<h2>What is SpaceAge?</h2>
		<p>
		  Explore a galaxy connected by ancient Points — stable wormholes that enable faster-than-light travel.
		  Play as one of ten galactic Interests (corporations, fleets, or associations), pursuing your own goals
		  over quarterly turns of in-game strategy.
		</p>
		<p>
		  Build colonies, explore distant systems, trade resources, develop technology, or wage war across the stars.
		  There is no forced victory condition — only the goals you set for yourself and your faction.
		</p>
	  </div>

	  <div class="pbem-intro card">
		<h3>How Play-by-Email Works</h3>
		<p>
		  You do not log into a live game. Instead, you read last quarter's report (text for now, visual tools later),
		  discuss strategy, and submit orders. When all factions are ready, the game engine processes the turn and
		  publishes new reports. The cycle repeats each quarter.
		</p>
	  </div>

	  <div class="cta-buttons">
		<a href="/client" class="button">Open the Client</a>
		<a href="/turns" class="button button-secondary">View Turn Status</a>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="hero-visual">
	  <div class="placeholder-visual">
		<p>★ Star Map Preview ★</p>
		<p style="font-size: 3rem; margin: 1rem 0;">✦</p>
		<p>Visual Tool Coming Soon</p>
	  </div>
	</div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-section">
	<h2>Game Status</h2>
	<StatusDashboard />
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
	<h2>Game Features</h2>
	<div class="features-grid">
	  <div class="card">
		<h3>Quarterly Turns</h3>
		<p>Each turn represents 13 weeks of in-game time. Strategy and diplomacy unfold across months of real time.</p>
	  </div>
	  <div class="card">
		<h3>Deep Technology Tree</h3>
		<p>Research and develop technologies across 10 levels, from basic fusion drives to advanced weapons and modules.</p>
	  </div>
	  <div class="card">
		<h3>Rich Simulation</h3>
		<p>Combat mechanics, resource management, crew skills, planetary environments, and diplomacy all affect your success.</p>
	  </div>
	</div>
  </section>

  <section class="rules-preview-section card">
	<h2>Quick Start</h2>
	<p>New to SpaceAge? Start with the <a href="/rules">rules overview</a> to understand the core mechanics.</p>
	<p>Want to dive deeper? Check out the <a href="/client">client page</a> for installation and getting started.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="credits-section">
	<h2>Lineage & Credits</h2>
	<p>
	  SpaceAge is built on the legacy of <strong>Atlantis</strong>, a legendary play-by-email game,
	  and <strong>Rise of Heroes</strong>. The engine and campaign design owe much to
	  <strong>Vincent Archer</strong>'s work and vision for open PBEM strategy gaming.
	</p>
	<p style="margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: #999;">
	  Engine Version: 0.1.157 | Campaign Launch: 2026 | Quarterly Play Schedule
	</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
	gap: var(--space-2xl);
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-content {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero h1 {
	font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
	color: var(--color-accent-teal);
	margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .tagline {
	font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
	color: var(--color-accent-amber);
	font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .flavour {
	background-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
	padding: var(--space-lg);
	border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-teal);
	border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .flavour h2 {
	margin-top: 0;
	color: var(--color-accent-teal);
	font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
  }

  .pbem-intro {
	margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
	display: flex;
	gap: var(--space-md);
	flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .button-secondary {
	background-color: var(--color-accent-blue);
  }

  .hero-visual {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
  }

  .placeholder-visual {
	background-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.05);
	border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-teal);
	border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
	padding: var(--space-2xl);
	text-align: center;
	color: #666;
  }

  .dashboard-section {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .features-section {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .features-grid {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
	gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .rules-preview-section {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .credits-section {
	background-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.05);
	padding: var(--space-lg);
	border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
	text-align: center;
	border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
	.hero {
	  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
	}

	.cta-buttons {
	  flex-direction: column;
	}

	.button {
	  width: 100%;
	  text-align: center;
	}
  }
</style>
